    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cSupercar Collection Simulator Prologue\u201d is a game where you can collect cars and earn money by selling surprise car boxes.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453570/extras/4c146dffea4c8f566a44e4a6a91269bb.poster.avif?t=1742835536\" width=754 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453570/extras/4c146dffea4c8f566a44e4a6a91269bb.webm?t=1742835536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453570/extras/4c146dffea4c8f566a44e4a6a91269bb.mp4?t=1742835536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and offer for sale different Supercar series. Each series has different features and advantages.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453570/extras/e28220bf40d1634111dd6075dbac18b3.poster.avif?t=1742835536\" width=754 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453570/extras/e28220bf40d1634111dd6075dbac18b3.webm?t=1742835536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453570/extras/e28220bf40d1634111dd6075dbac18b3.mp4?t=1742835536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up racing platforms in your store and give players the opportunity to race. Make money from racing!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453570/extras/888c2d60bc9f9709ab77124accdabb6a.poster.avif?t=1742835536\" width=754 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453570/extras/888c2d60bc9f9709ab77124accdabb6a.webm?t=1742835536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453570/extras/888c2d60bc9f9709ab77124accdabb6a.mp4?t=1742835536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your Supercar store the way you want. Unlock Supercar series, order surprise boxes and place them on your shelves to make sales. Create the perfect store for lovers of collectibles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453570/extras/a216055cc2441b5c0674ea895982f2b4.poster.avif?t=1742835536\" width=754 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453570/extras/a216055cc2441b5c0674ea895982f2b4.webm?t=1742835536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453570/extras/a216055cc2441b5c0674ea895982f2b4.mp4?t=1742835536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enrich your collection with cars from Supercar boxes. Find and sell rare and valuable cars for a profit, or collect them to complete your collection.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453570/extras/347ff06bf93ac1573c8a546cd2cdfa8a.poster.avif?t=1742835536\" width=754 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453570/extras/347ff06bf93ac1573c8a546cd2cdfa8a.webm?t=1742835536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453570/extras/347ff06bf93ac1573c8a546cd2cdfa8a.mp4?t=1742835536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attract more customers by upgrading your store! Win new customers and increase your profits with new shelves, racing platforms, Supercar boxes and collectibles.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cSupercar Collection Simulator Prologue\u201d is a game where you can collect cars and earn money by selling surprise car boxes.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453570/extras/4c146dffea4c8f566a44e4a6a91269bb.poster.avif?t=1742835536\" width=754 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453570/extras/4c146dffea4c8f566a44e4a6a91269bb.webm?t=1742835536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453570/extras/4c146dffea4c8f566a44e4a6a91269bb.mp4?t=1742835536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and offer for sale different Supercar series. Each series has different features and advantages.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453570/extras/e28220bf40d1634111dd6075dbac18b3.poster.avif?t=1742835536\" width=754 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453570/extras/e28220bf40d1634111dd6075dbac18b3.webm?t=1742835536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453570/extras/e28220bf40d1634111dd6075dbac18b3.mp4?t=1742835536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up racing platforms in your store and give players the opportunity to race. Make money from racing!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453570/extras/888c2d60bc9f9709ab77124accdabb6a.poster.avif?t=1742835536\" width=754 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453570/extras/888c2d60bc9f9709ab77124accdabb6a.webm?t=1742835536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453570/extras/888c2d60bc9f9709ab77124accdabb6a.mp4?t=1742835536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your Supercar store the way you want. Unlock Supercar series, order surprise boxes and place them on your shelves to make sales. Create the perfect store for lovers of collectibles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453570/extras/a216055cc2441b5c0674ea895982f2b4.poster.avif?t=1742835536\" width=754 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453570/extras/a216055cc2441b5c0674ea895982f2b4.webm?t=1742835536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453570/extras/a216055cc2441b5c0674ea895982f2b4.mp4?t=1742835536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enrich your collection with cars from Supercar boxes. Find and sell rare and valuable cars for a profit, or collect them to complete your collection.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453570/extras/347ff06bf93ac1573c8a546cd2cdfa8a.poster.avif?t=1742835536\" width=754 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453570/extras/347ff06bf93ac1573c8a546cd2cdfa8a.webm?t=1742835536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453570/extras/347ff06bf93ac1573c8a546cd2cdfa8a.mp4?t=1742835536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attract more customers by upgrading your store! Win new customers and increase your profits with new shelves, racing platforms, Supercar boxes and collectibles.</p>",
